  "question": {
    "text": "Work done by a Carnot engine operating between temperatures <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>127</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math>. The amount of heat transferred to the engine by the reservoir is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The temperatures in Kelvin scales are&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>127</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>The efficiency of the Carnot engine&nbsp;is</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>300</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />Using the relation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
